Description: Welcome screen for MX Linux
 MX Welcome displays a responsive dashboard for MX Linux.
 .
 The welcome dashboard provides searchable, categorized access to useful
 resources and tools.
 .
 The system page provides basic information about the current MX Linux
 version, the user's hardware, and access to a full system report.
